  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.9.0 - Nullable reference type annotations for all of Box2D, plus fixes found while converting: b2Body.DestroyFixture no longer hangs, and b2World.Step unlocks the world when a callback throws. Creating a body, joint or fixture, or calling Step, while the world is stepping now throws InvalidOperationException, instead of returning null or running a nested step. Apart from nullability, no public API changed. Read the CHANGELOG's Upgrading notes before updating.\n2.8.0 - No Box2D changes; version aligned with the Cocos2D-Mono 2.8.0 release line. Box2D isn't annotated for nullable reference types yet.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
